+
+## Normal shared LanguageTag owner (task197)
+
+Task197 (`202610160534-Z7BW2Y`) is in progress. The actual normal value owner
+connects existing shared Locale/OUString/MsLangId, structural extraction,
+ordered fallbacks and the normal external parser. Constructors include the
+four separate ODF language attributes, with explicit BCP47 precedence. Copy,
+assignment, reset, lazy canonicalization/field queries and normal static
+conversions operate on the same shared values. Semantic BCP47, raw-ID and SYSTEM
+registries use native Maps; JS GC owns their objects. Dynamic identifiers keep
+the original finite range, collision rules and shared script metadata.
+
+The first portable related check passes423tests in24files with all5reference
+links absent/restored, including actual1922-ID rollover/exhaustion and the
+source Norwegian collision cases. The new normal-owner coverage remains below
+the required raw100 gate; this task is not verified or finished. CALC-184 records
+the confirmed source initialization-order effect for short numeric regions.
+Inventory/provenance maps each responsibility without promoting broad parity.
+
+POSIX rtl_Locale/glibc operations and unrelated full library APIs are outside
+this normal-owner task. Chromium/Worker, wholeCalc and final source-gate checks
+remain pending. Font integration/defaults, real Calc pools/document/sheet/column
+and same-model ODS import/export still need implementation before the minimum
+UI milestone and the requested final all-application test run.
